menu "Thread Joiner"

config THREAD_JOINER_PSKD_DEFAULT
    string "Default PSKd (Joiner credential)"
    default "H01THREAD"
    help
        Default PSKd for Thread commissioning (6-32 chars, base32-thread).
        Must match "commissioner joiner add * <pskd>" on Border Router.

config THREAD_JOINER_RETRY_SEC
    int "Joiner retry interval (seconds) - loi chung"
    default 30
    range 10 300
    help
        Khi Joiner that bai (loi khac NotFound), tu dong thu lai sau N giay.

config THREAD_JOINER_RETRY_NOT_FOUND_SEC
    int "Joiner retry interval (seconds) khi loi NotFound - Commissioner chua bat"
    default 5
    range 2 60
    help
        Khi Joiner tra ve NotFound (Commissioner chua san sang), thu lai sau N giay thay vi RETRY_SEC.

endmenu
